id: VS-01
name: Risk Sensing
short_description: Maintain a continuously refreshed context so risk work is evidence-driven
  and timely.
owner: null
stakeholders:
- Risk Function, Business Leaders, Security, Ops, Compliance/Legal, Strategy teams
triggers:
- External shocks, regulatory change, supplier disruption, material trends in incidents,
  threat intel updates.
inputs:
- Threat intel, regulatory feeds, macro indicators, Incidents, audit findings, complaints,
  supplier performance.
entry_criteria: ''
key_activities:
- 1) Define sensing scope and critical dependencies
- 2) Ingest external signals
- 3) Ingest internal operational signals
- 4) Consult stakeholders and validate implications
- 5) Update context assumptions and dependency maps
- 6) Publish emerging risk watchlist
decisions_and_gates: []
outputs:
- Sensing dashboard, emerging risk list.
exit_criteria: ''
metrics: 'Flow: signal-to-triage time; triage throughput; WIP of unreviewed signals.<br>Performance:
  relevance score of signals; stakeholder utilisation.<br>Risk: “surprise events”
  count; % emerging risks reviewed.'
source_file: docs\value-architecture\value-streams\VS-01-risk-sensing.md
last_updated: '2026-02-01T13:05:19.774213Z'
